### Connected Vehicle Platform — REST endpoint tests
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or IntelliJ HTTP client.
### Requests go through the API gateway (8080); direct-service URLs are shown too.

@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@ingestion = http://localhost:8081
@decoder = http://localhost:8082
@storage = http://localhost:8083
@diagnostics = http://localhost:8084
@analytics = http://localhost:8085

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Gateway index (lists routes + swagger links)
GET {{gateway}}/

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### CAN Ingestion — status
GET {{gateway}}/api/ingestion/status

### Direct
GET {{ingestion}}/api/ingestion/status

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### DBC Decoder — list loaded message/signal definitions
GET {{gateway}}/api/decoder/messages

### Decode a single raw frame on demand (EngineData, canId 256/0x100).
### data below encodes EngineSpeed≈2500rpm, CoolantTemp≈92C, Throttle≈40%
POST {{gateway}}/api/decoder/decode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": "TEST-1",
  "canId": 256,
  "dlc": 8,
  "data": "1027840000000000"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Telemetry Storage — list vehicles
GET {{gateway}}/api/telemetry/vehicles

### Latest value per signal for a vehicle
GET {{gateway}}/api/telemetry/VIN-0001/latest

### Query a signal over a time range (defaults to last hour if omitted)
GET {{gateway}}/api/telemetry?vehicleId=VIN-0001&signal=CoolantTemp&limit=100

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Predictive Diagnostics — all vehicle health scores
GET {{gateway}}/api/diagnostics/health

### One vehicle's health
GET {{gateway}}/api/diagnostics/health/VIN-0001

### Active alerts
GET {{gateway}}/api/diagnostics/alerts?activeOnly=true&limit=50

### All alerts for a vehicle
GET {{gateway}}/api/diagnostics/alerts?vehicleId=VIN-0001&limit=50

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Fleet Analytics — summary
GET {{gateway}}/api/fleet/summary

### Top fault codes
GET {{gateway}}/api/fleet/top-faults?limit=10

### Alerts per vehicle
GET {{gateway}}/api/fleet/alerts-per-vehicle

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Observability
GET {{ingestion}}/actuator/prometheus

GET {{diagnostics}}/actuator/health
